  "release_notes": "Specs per official UNICAM datasheet (UC-FHD-3200-L2-SY-SL-AU.pdf). Analog HD camera (4-in-1 AHD/TVI/CVI/CVBS output); no IP stream. Image-only datasheet read visually. Its cover calls it a 'bullet network camera' and shows H.265/PoE/VCA icons, but the spec table lists only AHD/TVI/CVI/CVBS output and DC12V power, so it is recorded as analog. IR range stated as 10-20 m; min. illumination 0.005 lux @ F1.2, AGC on. The datasheet's minimum-illumination figure does not say whether it is colour or black-and-white, so it is not recorded.",
